</notes>
<segment>
<source>Version 3.8</source>
</segment>
</unit>
<unit id="2662d311-cff0-4b6d-a667-b877ce7efe85">
<notes>
<note appliesTo="source">line: 60</note>
<note appliesTo="source">prefix: * </note>
</notes>
<segment>
<source>Update to Unicode 17.0.</source>
</segment>
</unit>
<unit id="d8a44f25-cef9-4367-9406-d502b31d7d6c">
<notes>
<note appliesTo="source">line: 61</note>
<note appliesTo="source">prefix: * </note>
</notes>
<segment>
<source>Fixed a bug causing the review cursor at the end of a line to jump to next line when moved right, instead of reporting the end of the line.</source>
</segment>
</unit>
<unit id="9b7b9156-17a1-43a8-831c-079f4374d2c8">
<notes>
<note appliesTo="source">line: 62</note>
<note appliesTo="source">prefix: * </note>
</notes>
<segment>
<source>Compatibility with NVDA 2026.1.</source>
</segment>
</unit>
<unit id="352d62d3-ba3a-4f98-9244-5f4f819644d5">
